{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:annotationcanshowcallout:"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"MLNMapViewDelegate.h","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNMapViewDelegate.h#L880"},"externalID":"c:objc(pl)MLNMapViewDelegate(im)mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a Boolean value indicating whether the annotation is able to display"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extra information in a callout bubble."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView","text":"MLNMapView"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"mapView"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"annotationCanShowCallout:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNAnnotation","text":"id<MLNAnnotation>"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"annotation"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The map view that has selected the annotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"mapView"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The object representing the annotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"annotation"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether the annotation should show a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callout."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is called after an annotation is selected, before any callout is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displayed for the annotation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the return value is "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a callout view is shown when the user taps on an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotation, selecting it. The default callout displays the annotation’s title"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and subtitle. You can add accessory views to either end of the callout by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implementing the "},{"code":"-mapView:leftCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" methods. You can further"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"customize the callout’s contents by implementing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the return value is "},{"code":"NO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or if this method is absent from the delegate, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if the annotation lacks a title, the annotation will not show a callout even"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when selected."}]},{"anchor":"Related-examples","type":"heading","text":"Related examples","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Add annotation views and images"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Display custom views as callouts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Default callout usage, learn how to show callouts for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" objects."}]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a Boolean value indicating whether the annotation is able to display","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extra information in a callout bubble.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:annotationcanshowcallout:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate":{"type":"topic","title":"MLNMapViewDelegate","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" protocol defines a set of optional methods that you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can use to receive map-related update messages. Because many map operations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"require the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" class to load data asynchronously, the map view calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these methods to notify your application when specific operations complete. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"map view also uses these methods to request information about annotations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"displayed on the map, such as the styles and interaction modes to apply to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"individual annotations.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapViewDelegate"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotation":{"type":"topic","title":"MLNAnnotation","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol is used to provide annotation-related information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a map view. To use this protocol, you adopt it in any custom objects that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"store or represent annotation data. Each object then serves as the source of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects to handle the display."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotation","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNAnnotation"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNMapView","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapView"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An interactive, customizable map view with an interface similar to the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided by Apple’s MapKit."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview","kind":"symbol"}}}